+## Commands at a glance
+
+| Command  | What it does                                |
+|----------|---------------------------------------------|
+| `add`    | Record an expense                           |
+| `report` | Category totals for a month                 |
+| `list`   | Individual expenses for a month             |
+| `stats`  | Overall summary (count, total, date span)   |
+| `budget` | Spending against configured monthly budgets |
+| `export` | Write all expenses to CSV                   |
 
